  "header_text": "Black & Veatch CONTACT NEWS & EVENTS SUPPLIER LOCATIONS ABOUT US WHO WE SERVE WHAT WE DO PROJECTS INSIGHTS CAREERS Quick Links Infrastructure Advisory Construction Power Generation Power Delivery Water Process Fuels Environmental Mission Critical Lifecycle Services OUR SOLUTIONS LIFECYCLE SERVICES OUR SUSTAINABLE VISION OUR COMPANY CONTACT US | Inventive to our core. Reliable by design. At Black & Veatch, we see the world not just as it is, but as it could be. Coal plants reborn as renewable energy hubs. Coastlines transformed to take on flood threats. Safe power and clean water sourced closer to home. Local workforces building a low-carbon future. Infrastructure that protects the planet and empowers all people. That's Bolder Vision. That's Black & Veatch. Learn more | OUR SUSTAINABLE VISION Building for today's needs while securing a sustainable tomorrow. Explore more | CONTACT US Seeking a partner with proven expertise? Let's talk",
  "footer_text": "Read More | Read More | Read More | Read More | About Us Leadership and Governance Sustainability Employee Ownership Impact Investing in Innovation Safety and Health Awards and Rankings Diversity, Equity and Inclusion History Foundation Who we serve Technology and Data Centers Industrial and Manufacturing Fuels and Natural Resources Power Providers Water Utilities Federal Agencies Public Sector Commercial What we do Infrastructure Advisory Construction Power Generation Power Delivery Water Process Fuels Environmental Mission Critical Lifecycle Services News & Insights Newsroom Events Insights and Resources Careers Workplace Culture Our Hiring Process Career Paths Craft and Construction Early Careers and Students ENT Accelerator Program Experienced Careers Military Veterans Accessibility Privacy policy Terms of use Compliance Copyright © 2026 Black & Veatch Corporation. All rights reserved.",
  "above_fold_text": "Black & Veatch Contact News & Events Supplier Locations About Us Who we serve What we do Projects Insights Careers Quick Links Infrastructure Advisory Construction Power Generation Power Delivery Water Process Fuels Environmental Mission Critical Lifecycle Services Our Solutions Lifecycle Services Our sustainable vision our company Contact us Bold infrastructure our future depends on See Bolder Vision in action New world headquarters breaks ground Learn more Construction safety, quality, schedule certainty Learn more Sustainability report: purpose. performance. Learn more Bold infrastructure our future depends on New world headquarters breaks ground Construction safety, quality, schedule certainty Sustainability report: purpose. performance. Inventive to our core. Reliable by design. Ao clicar em \"Aceitar todos os cookies\", concorda com o armazenamento de cookies no seu dispositivo para melhorar a navegação no site, analisar a utilização do site e ajudar nas nossas iniciativas de marketing. Definições de cookies Rejeitar Todos Aceitar todos os cookies",
  "visible_text": "Black & Veatch\nCONTACT\nNEWS & EVENTS\nSUPPLIER\nLOCATIONS\nABOUT US\nWHO WE SERVE\nWHAT WE DO\nPROJECTS\nINSIGHTS\nCAREERS\nQuick Links\nInfrastructure Advisory\nConstruction\nPower Generation\nPower Delivery\nWater\nProcess\nFuels\nEnvironmental\nMission Critical\nLifecycle Services\nOUR SOLUTIONS\nLIFECYCLE SERVICES\nOUR SUSTAINABLE VISION\nOUR COMPANY\nCONTACT US\nBold infrastructure our future depends on\nSee Bolder Vision in action\nNew world headquarters breaks ground\nLearn more\nConstruction safety, quality, schedule certainty\nLearn more\nSustainability report: purpose. performance.\nLearn more\nBold infrastructure our future depends on\nNew world headquarters breaks ground\nConstruction safety, quality, schedule certainty\nSustainability report: purpose. performance.\n\nInventive to our core. Reliable by design.\n\nAt Black & Veatch, we see the world not just as it is, but as it could be. Coal plants reborn as renewable energy hubs. Coastlines transformed to take on flood threats. Safe power and clean water sourced closer to home. Local workforces building a low-carbon future. Infrastructure that protects the planet and empowers all people. That's Bolder Vision. That's Black & Veatch.\n\nLearn more\n\nComplex infrastructure across the planet relies on Black & Veatch's ingenuity. Together, let's create a Bolder Vision for resilience and growth.\n\n1\n1\n0\n+\nYEARS IN BUSINESS\n7\n,\n0\n0\n0\n+\nACTIVE PROJECTS\n~\n1\n3\n,\n0\n0\n0\nEMPLOYEES\nSolving today’s infrastructure challenges\n\nBlack & Veatch’s trusted and sustainable power, water, process, and advisory solutions address our clients’ needs, no matter their industry.\n\nSOLUTIONS SPOTLIGHT\nPower Delivery\n\nIgnite growth and innovation with intelligent, resilient power delivery solutions.\n\nLearn more\nHydrogen\n\nWe understand the potential to reduce emissions and pave the way for a greener future.\n\nLearn more\nPower Delivery\n\nIgnite growth and innovation with intelligent, resilient power delivery solutions.\n\nLearn more\nPROJECTS\nDeveloping biomass gasification for hydrogen production\n\nA major player in the UK energy sector commissioned Black & Veatch’s Europe, Middle East and Africa (EMEA) team to investigate biomass gasification, coupled with carbon capture, as a source of hydrogen.\n\nRead More\nPROJECTS\nDelivering the Philippines’ first LNG-to-power project\nRead More\nPROJECTS\nPlant Upgrade Minimizes Wastewater Discharge into Ocean, Maximizes Production of Recycled Water\nRead More\nPROJECTS\nBlack & Veatch client’s sustainability project to increase production at world’s largest copper mine\nRead More\n\nLifecycle services\n\nWe’ll meet you where you are.\n\nCLICK ICON TO EXPAND\n\nStrategy and planning\nEngineering\nAsset performance\nProcurement\nConstruction\nDecommissioning\nOUR SUSTAINABLE VISION\nBuilding for today's needs while securing a sustainable tomorrow.\nExplore more\nOUR COMPANY\nOur purpose\n\nBuilding a World of Difference®\n\nLearn more\nOur people\n\n100% employee owned\n\nLearn more\nOur insights\n\nThoughts from our leadership on projects and innovation\n\nLearn more\nCONTACT US\nSeeking a partner with proven expertise?\nLet's talk\nAbout Us\nLeadership and Governance\nSustainability\nEmployee Ownership Impact\nInvesting in Innovation\nSafety and Health\nAwards and Rankings\nDiversity, Equity and Inclusion\nHistory\nFoundation\nWho we serve\nTechnology and Data Centers\nIndustrial and Manufacturing\nFuels and Natural Resources\nPower Providers\nWater Utilities\nFederal Agencies\nPublic Sector\nCommercial\nWhat we do\nInfrastructure Advisory\nConstruction\nPower Generation\nPower Delivery\nWater\nProcess\nFuels\nEnvironmental\nMission Critical\nLifecycle Services\nNews & Insights\nNewsroom\nEvents\nInsights and Resources\nCareers\nWorkplace Culture\nOur Hiring Process\nCareer Paths\nCraft and Construction\nEarly Careers and Students\nENT Accelerator Program\nExperienced Careers\nMilitary Veterans\nAccessibility\nPrivacy policy\nTerms of use\nCompliance\n\nCopyright © 2026 Black & Veatch Corporation. All rights reserved.\n\nAo clicar em \"Aceitar todos os cookies\", concorda com o armazenamento de cookies no seu dispositivo para melhorar a navegação no site, analisar a utilização do site e ajudar nas nossas iniciativas de marketing.\nDefinições de cookies Rejeitar Todos Aceitar todos os cookies",
